event: delta
data: {"text":"`。执行后，投票数更多的《When We Cease to Understand the World》排在了前面。\n2. 文本按字母"}

event: delta
data: {"text":"排序：`ORDER BY` 同样适用于文本列。`SELECT \"title\" FROM \"longlist\" ORDER BY \"title\";` 默认"}

